text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'All artifacts have "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this artifact unless you pay {2}."', "All creatures have forestwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "All lands become 2/2 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands.", 'Any player may cast creature and enchantment spells as though they had flash.', "Artifacts and enchantments you control have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", "As Chameleon Spirit enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nChameleon Spirit's power and toughness are each equal to the number of permanents of the chosen color your opponents control.", "As Conspiracy enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nCreatures you control are the chosen type. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield.", 'As Jeweled Torque enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nWhenever a player casts a spell of the chosen color, you may pay {2}. If you do, you gain 2 life.', 'As Story Circle enters the battlefield, choose a color.\n{W}: The next time a source of your choice of the chosen color would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, choose a creature type.\nCaller of the Hunt's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures of the chosen type on the battlefield.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Barbed Wire deals 1 damage to that player.\n{2}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt by Barbed Wire this turn.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player may put a +1/+1 counter on target creature of their choice.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player mills a card.", "At the beginning of your end step, if you didn't play a land this turn, you may draw a card.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, each player reveals the top card of their library. If all cards revealed this way are creature cards, put those cards onto the battlefield under their owners' control.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if Nether Spirit is the only creature card in your graveyard, you may return Nether Spirit to the battlefield.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Lithophage unless you sacrifice a Mountain.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Territorial Dispute unless you sacrifice a land.\nPlayers can't play lands.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile the top card of your library face down.\n{5}, Discard your hand, Sacrifice Kyren Archive: Put all cards exiled with Kyren Archive into their owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may have Kyren Sniper deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may return Squee, Goblin Nabob from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Choose a card type. Target opponent reveals their hand. Blood Oath deals 3 damage to that player for each card of the chosen type revealed this way. (Artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal are card types.)', "Choose target creature. At this turn's next end of combat, destroy all creatures that blocked or were blocked by it this turn.", 'Counter target spell.', 'Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each card in your hand.', 'Creatures played by your opponents enter the battlefield tapped.', "Creatures target player controls don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 and have reach. (They can block creatures with flying.)', "Creatures you control have fear. (They can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Defender\n{T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{2}{B}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{T}: Add {G}.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{T}: Target creature gets +0/+4 until end of turn.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{U}, {T}: Stinging Barrier deals 1 damage to any target.", 'Destroy all creatures with mana value X or less.', 'Destroy all enchantments.', "Destroy target Wall. It can't be regenerated. Word of Blasting deals damage equal to that Wall's mana value to the Wall's controller.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. Its controller creates a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated. You gain life equal to its toughness.", "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated. You lose life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Destroy target permanent.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.', 'Each attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each nonbasic land defending player controls.', 'Each creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Each player reveals the top five cards of their library, puts all land cards revealed this way onto the battlefield tapped, and exiles the rest.', 'Each player sacrifices X lands.', 'Enchant creature\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of the end step of enchanted creature's controller, Insubordination deals 2 damage to that player unless that creature attacked this turn.", "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, Unnatural Hunger deals damage equal to that creature's power to that player unless they sacrifice another creature.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has mountainwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each other enchantment on the battlefield.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has vigilance.\nSacrifice Stamina: Regenerate enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nPay 2 life: Regenerate enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt by enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\nShroud (A permanent with shroud can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nEnchanted creature has shroud.", 'Enchant creature\nWhen enchanted creature dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature becomes blocked, tap all lands defending player controls.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature blocks or becomes blocked, you may put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a creature, gain control of the other creature for as long as Charisma remains on the battlefield.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Exile X target creature cards from your graveyard. For each creature card exiled this way, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Exile a creature you control: Add X mana of any one color, where X is 1 plus the exiled creature's mana value. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.", 'Exile all creature cards from all graveyards. You gain 1 life for each card exiled this way.', 'Exile all nontoken permanents. Starting with you, each player chooses one of the exiled cards and puts it onto the battlefield tapped under their control. Repeat this process until all cards exiled this way have been chosen.', 'Exile target creature with power 2 or less. Its controller gains 4 life.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\n{4}, {T}: Search your library for a Mercenary permanent card with mana value 4 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", 'First strike', 'First strike\n{5}, {T}: Search your library for a Rebel permanent card with mana value 4 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Flash\nEnchant creature\nAs Cho-Manno's Blessing enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nEnchanted creature has protection from the chosen color. This effect doesn't remove Cho-Manno's Blessing.", 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has first strike.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/-2.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.', 'Flip a coin. If you win the flip, destroy all creatures with power 2 or less. If you lose the flip, destroy all creatures with power 3 or greater.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Extravagant Spirit unless you pay {1} for each card in your hand.', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Molting Harpy unless you pay {2}.', "Flying\nBattle Squadron's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", "Flying\nKyren Glider can't block.", "Flying\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nTwo-Headed Dragon can block an additional creature each combat.\n{1}{R}: Two-Headed Dragon gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying\nRishadan Airship can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\nWhen Charmed Griffin enters the battlefield, each other player may put an artifact or enchantment card onto the battlefield from their hand.', 'Flying\nWhen Indentured Djinn enters the battlefield, each other player may draw up to three cards.', 'Flying\nWhen Rishadan Brigand enters the battlefield, each opponent sacrifices a permanent unless they pay {3}.\nRishadan Brigand can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\nWhen another creature enters the battlefield, return Timid Drake to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nWhenever Caustic Wasps deals combat damage to a player, you may destroy target artifact that player controls.', 'Flying\nWhenever Robber Fly becomes blocked, defending player discards all the cards in their hand, then draws that many cards.', 'Flying\nWhenever Venomous Dragonfly blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Flying\n{1}{U}{U}: Exile the top card of your library. Until end of turn, you may play that card. (Reveal the card as you exile it.)', 'Flying\n{2}{W}: Rappelling Scouts gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{7}, {T}: Search your library for a Rebel permanent card with mana value 6 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Flying\n{U}: Drake Hatchling gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nCloud Sprite can block only creatures with flying.", 'Flying, first strike\n{1}: Flailing Manticore gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.\n{1}: Flailing Manticore gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Flying, protection from black', 'Flying, protection from red', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Fountain of Cho enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Put a storage counter on Fountain of Cho.\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Fountain of Cho: Add {W} for each storage counter removed this way.', "Haste\nWhenever Lava Runner becomes the target of a spell or ability, that spell or ability's controller sacrifices a land.", 'Hickory Woodlot enters the battlefield tapped with two depletion counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a depletion counter from Hickory Woodlot: Add {G}{G}. If there are no depletion counters on Hickory Woodlot, sacrifice it.', 'If an opponent controls a Forest and you control a Swamp, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\n{B}: Deepwood Legate gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'If an opponent controls a Mountain and you control an Island, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\nFlying', 'If an opponent controls a Plains and you control a Mountain, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\nHaste', 'If an opponent controls a Swamp and you control a Plains, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.\nProtection from black', 'If an opponent controls an Island and you control a Forest, you may cast this spell without paying its mana cost.', 'If damage would be dealt to a player, that player exiles that many cards from the top of their library instead.', "If you control a Forest, rather than pay this spell's mana cost, you may have an opponent gain 3 life.\nTarget creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.", "If you control a Plains, you may tap an untapped creature you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nCreatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.", "If you control a Plains, you may tap an untapped creature you control rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nPrevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.", "If you control a Swamp, you may pay 2 life rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nTarget creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", "If you control a Swamp, you may pay 4 life rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nDestroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "If you have no land cards in hand, you may reveal your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nSearch your library for a Forest card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nYou may choose not to untap Sand Squid during your untap step.\n{T}: Tap target creature. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Sand Squid remains tapped.", "Look at target player's hand and choose up to two cards from it. That player discards those cards.", 'Lunge deals 2 damage to target creature and 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Mercadian Bazaar enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Put a storage counter on Mercadian Bazaar.\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Mercadian Bazaar: Add {R} for each storage counter removed this way.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)\n{R}: Cavern Crawler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Nonartifact creatures get +2/+2 as long as they all share a color.', "Nonland permanents don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 2 life.", "Nonwhite creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", 'Pay 2 life: Regenerate Deepwood Ghoul.', 'Peat Bog enters the battlefield tapped with two depletion counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a depletion counter from Peat Bog: Add {B}{B}. If there are no depletion counters on Peat Bog, sacrifice it.', "Players can't cast spells with the same name as a nontoken permanent.\nPlayers can't play nonbasic lands with the same name as a nontoken permanent.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by creatures you control.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Cho-Manno, Revolutionary.', "Rampart Crawler can't be blocked by Walls.", 'Red creature spells and green creature spells cost {1} more to cast.', 'Remote Farm enters the battlefield tapped with two depletion counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a depletion counter from Remote Farm: Add {W}{W}. If there are no depletion counters on Remote Farm, sacrifice it.', "Return target artifact, enchantment, or land to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Rushwood Grove enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Put a storage counter on Rushwood Grove.\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Rushwood Grove: Add {G} for each storage counter removed this way.', 'Sacrifice Shock Troops: It deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Regenerate Cateran Overlord.\n{6}, {T}: Search your library for a Mercenary permanent card with mana value 6 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Sacrifice any number of permanents. You gain 2 life for each permanent sacrificed this way.', 'Sandstone Needle enters the battlefield tapped with two depletion counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a depletion counter from Sandstone Needle: Add {R}{R}. If there are no depletion counters on Sandstone Needle, sacrifice it.', 'Saprazzan Cove enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Put a storage counter on Saprazzan Cove.\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Saprazzan Cove: Add {U} for each storage counter removed this way.', 'Saprazzan Skerry enters the battlefield tapped with two depletion counters on it.\n{T}, Remove a depletion counter from Saprazzan Skerry: Add {U}{U}. If there are no depletion counters on Saprazzan Skerry, sacrifice it.', "Search target opponent's library for a creature card and put that card onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles.", 'Search your library for a Mercenary card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a permanent card with the same name as target nontoken creature, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Sizzle deals 3 damage to each opponent.', 'Sorcery spells cost {3} more to cast.'